WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:05.205
&gt;&gt;&gt; A FEDERAL JUE HAS SENTENCE
A JANUARY 6 RIOTER TO SEVEN

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:08.241
YEARS IN PRISON WHICH IS THE
LONGEST SENTENCE SO FAR FOR

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.810
PARTICIPANTS IN THE CAPITOL
INSURRECTION.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:14.781
SENTENCING FOR GUY REFFITT COMES
NEARLY 20 MONTHS AFTER HE

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:19.752
BROUGHT A GUN TO THE CAPITOL AND
THREATENED HOUSE SPEAKER NANCY

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:23.923
PELOSI.
BACK IN MARCH, A D.C. JURY

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:28.561
CONVICTED RED REFFITT OF FIVE
FELONIES.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.797
HERE'S HOW REFFITT'S DAUGHTERS
REACTED.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:35.768
&gt;&gt; TO MARK MY DAD AS A HORRIBLE
PERSON, TO HAVE A SENTENCE LIKE

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:39.906
WHERE SOMEBODY IS MAYBE ABLE TO
GET ELECTED AGAIN DOESN'T SEEM

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:42.608
RIGHT TO ME.
&gt;&gt; TRUMP DESERVES LIFE IN PRISON

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:44.978
IF MY FATHER IS IN PRISON FOR
THIS LONG.

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:52.652
&gt;&gt; JOINING US NOW IS GUY
REFFITT'S SON, JACKSON REFFITT.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:55.655
JACKSON WARNED THE FBI BEFORE
AND AFTER THE INSURRECTION.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:58.391
JACKSON, THANK YOU FOR BEING
WITH US THIS MORNING.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.994
HOW ARE YOU FEELING?
HOW ARE YOU REACTING TO THIS

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:03.696
SENTENCE?
&gt;&gt; I MEAN, I'M NOT HAPPY AT ALL.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.533
I HAVEN'T BEEN HAPPY TO THIS
WHOLE SITUATION.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:10.103
NO ONE IN MY FAMILY HAS EITHER,
BUT TO SAY I'M SURPRISED WOULD

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:14.974
BE A LIE.
I MEAN, EVERYTHING MY DAD DID,

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:18.978
HE'S HIS OWN PERSON.
AND HIS ACTION HAS CONSEQUENCES.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:22.015
BUT I'M NOT HAPPY AT ALL.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU THINK HE DESERVES THIS

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:29.055
LENGTH OF SENTENCE?
&gt;&gt; I MEAN, ABSOLUTELY.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:35.628
HE DESERVES SOME TIME.
WHETHER TO -- FOR ANYTHING, TO

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:38.665
REHABILITATE, FOR HIS MENTAL
HEALTH.

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:42.402
HE DESERVES A LOT OF SAFETY
NETS.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:46.973
BUT, YES, HE DOES.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU HAVE WORRIES ABOUT HIM

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:50.977
BEING IN PRISON THAT LONG.
YOU MENTIONED HIS MENTAL HEALTH.

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:55.381
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.
I MEAN, THE PRISON SYSTEM IN

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.717
THIS COUNTRY HAVE BEEN PRETTY
HARSH FOR A LOT OF REASONS.

00:01:57.717 --> 00:02:02.021
AND TO BLAME MY DAD'S
DETERIORATING MENTAL HEALTH FOR

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:05.858
A FRIDAY BAD EFFECT ON HIM, I'M
NOT GOING TO BE SURPRISED.

00:02:05.858 --> 00:02:10.930
BUT, I MEAN, THAT'S WHY I
MENTIONED IT IN MY LETTER.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:15.134
&gt;&gt; DO YOU KNOW, OR HAVE YOU
THROUGHOUT ANY OF THIS PROCESS

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:17.704
HAD ANY SECOND THOUGHTS ABOUT
TURNING HIM IN?

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:23.676
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOT.
BUT IT STILL BEARS THE GUILT

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:27.280
THAT HE IS HIS OWN PERSON AND HE
HAS MADE HIS OWN CHOICES.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:31.150
BUT HE'S ALSO BEEN PRETTY MUCH
MANIPULATED INTO MAKING THOSE

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:34.587
CHOICES.
AND IT PAINS ME THAT HE'S STILL

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:39.392
RESPONSIBLE FOR HIS ACTIONS.
&gt;&gt; JACKSON, I WANT TO TALK ABOUT

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:42.996
WHAT THIS HAS DONE TO YOUR
FAMILY.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:45.098
THIS IS YOUR MOM SPEAKING
YESTERDAY.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:50.570
I WANT TO LISTEN TO THIS.
&gt;&gt; NO MATTER IF YOU'RE A LIBERAL

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:54.340
IF YOU'RE AN INDEPENDENT, IF
YOU'RE A REPUBLICAN, THIS IS NOT

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.577
OKAY.
THIS IS WHAT THIS IS.

00:02:57.577 --> 00:03:02.649
IT'S POLITICAL PERSECUTION.
WE ARE PATRIOTS.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:06.753
ASHLI BABBITT WAS A PATRIOT.
MY HUSBAND IS A PATRIOT.

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:13.059
ROSE ANNE BOYLAN WAS A PATRIOT.
ALL I CAN SAY, Y'ALL CAN GO TO

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.295
HELL AND I'M GOING BACK TO
TEXAS.

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:20.600
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS YOUR RELATIONSHIP
LIKE WITH YOUR MOM, WITH YOUR

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.934
SISTERS?
&gt;&gt; IT'S BEEN REALLY HARD OVER

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:26.506
THE PAST COUPLE OF YEARS.
THEY'VE REALLY POLARIZING

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:30.043
DIFFERENCES IN HOW WE VIEW OUR
FATHER AND THE PEOPLE THAT ARE

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:35.048
INVOLVED IN COMMUNITIES SUCH AS
WHAT MY FATHER WAS IN.

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:39.352
BUT -- AND IT FEELS LIKE WE'RE
EACH PULLING ON EACH STRING, ONE

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:45.191
WAY.
BUT I DON'T VIEW THIS AS A

00:03:45.191 --> 00:03:48.828
POLITICAL MATTER.
THIS IS MORE OF WHAT IS MORALLY

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:55.468
CORRECT AND HOW TO GO ABOUT IT.
AND WHAT MY FATHER WAS

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:59.572
MANIPULATED INTO DOING AND WHAT
HE LED TO THINK WAS THE BEST AND

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:05.778
ONLY WAY TO DO IT, HE DECIDED,
AS AN ADULT, TO MAKE THOSE

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:08.047
CHOICES.
AND WHETHER MY FAMILY VIEWS IT

00:04:08.047 --> 00:04:13.853
ANY DIFFERENTLY, IT DOESN'T HAVE
AN EFFECT ON THE OUTCOME.

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:17.023
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU HEARD -- YOU HEARD
WHAT YOUR MOM SAID THERE.

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:21.828
WHAT DO YOU THINK ABOUT WHAT SHE
SAID?

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:27.566
&gt;&gt; THIS -- I MEAN,
REALISTICALLY, THIS DOESN'T HAVE

00:04:27.566 --> 00:04:32.105
A MATTER OF POLITICAL OPINION.
WHAT MY FATHER DID IS FAR FROM

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:33.706
POLITICS.
THIS IS COMPLETELY OFF THE RAILS

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:38.378
VIOLENCE.
WHETHER IT HAD A POLITICAL

00:04:38.378 --> 00:04:41.614
MOTIVE AT THIS POINT DOESN'T
MATTER.

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:45.485
IT'S MORE ABOUT WHAT HE DOES AND
WHO HE DID IT FOR.

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:51.224
&gt;&gt; IT SEEMS LIKE, YOU KNOW, YOUR
SISTER PEYTON, LISTENING TO HER,

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:53.726
SHE FEELS KIND OF CAUGHT IN THE
MIDDLE OF THIS.

00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:55.995
SHE'S THERE AT THE COURTHOUSE.
SHE LOVES YOU.

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:59.999
SHE MADE THAT CLEAR YESTERDAY.
SHE THINKS THAT YOUR DAD, IF

00:04:59.999 --> 00:05:03.136
