WHAT DO YOU SAY TO THAT?

00:05:04.537 --> 00:05:10.877
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.
WHEN SHE SAID THAT, I WAS

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:19.185
FLAFLAB
FLABBE

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:21.220
FLABBERGHASTED.
NOT ONLY WAS I IMPRESSED WITH

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:25.158
HER, SHE'S SO RIGHT.
MY DAD WAS USED AS A PUPPET, AND

00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:27.760
THOUSANDS OF FAMILIES HAVE BEEN.
WHETHER YOU AGREE WITH THAT,

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:32.665
IT'S A FACT AT THIS POINT.
IT IS DISGUSTING TO SEE THAT

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:36.335
SOMEONE WITH PRACTICALLY MONEY
