AND HAVE NO OUTCOME.

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:45.744
&gt;&gt; WHEN WE LOOK AT THIS SENTENCE
WHICH IS THE LONGEST ONE WE'VE

00:05:45.744 --> 00:05:49.949
