00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:13.272
BUT WHY DO YOU THINK THAT HE
WANTED TO DO THAT INITIALLY?

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:17.610
WHY DO YOU THINK HE WANTED TO BE
AN EXAMPLE?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:21.881
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T THINK -- I CAN'T
THINK OF ANYTHING OTHER THAN MY

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:27.587
OWN EXPERIENCE WITH MY FATHER,
KNOWING HE'S A NARCISSIST, AND

00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:32.058
HE HAS A RATHER LARGE EGO.
AND IT WAS HORRIBLE TO SEE HIM

00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:37.997
MAKE THAT DECISION, KNOWING THAT
HE COULD HAVE GOTTEN A MUCH

00:06:37.997 --> 00:06:41.133
