00:06:41.133 --> 00:06:46.739
DENIED IT, THAT HE WOULD DENY IT
AND TRY TO FIGHT IT IN COURT.

00:06:46.739 --> 00:06:52.278
AND I KNEW THAT IT WASN'T GOING
TO END UP OTHER THAN ANYTHING

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:54.747
THAT IT IS RIGHT NOW.
&gt;&gt; HAVE YOU TALKED TO HIM SINCE

00:06:54.747 --> 00:06:57.817
