00:07:48.901 --> 00:07:53.973
BUT I WOULD JUST TALK ABOUT THE
MOST POINTLESS STUFF, JUST TO

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:57.042
GO -- HAVE A ONE-ON-ONE WITH
