00:07:59.879 --> 00:08:03.983
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE HE'S YOUR DAD?
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:08:03.983 --> 00:08:08.754
HE'S STILL MY FATHER.
THAT DOESN'T JUSTIFY ANYTHING

00:08:08.754 --> 00:08:12.224
